{"reviews":[{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-0","r":4.0,"t":"LOVE the product--- price is debatable... but i still love the little guy!","x":"I was a little weary buying this product because reviews on other sites said that it smelled/ tasted strange and it was drying or it left a weird stain on their lips---- that was not the case for me and I 10000000% do NOT regret buying.  The PH changing concept was so interesting, and I don't know if it's actually the PH that adjusts it or just the warmth of your skin-- regardless it gave such a natural flushed color to my lips and went on smoothly and smelled amazing! (no taste to it at all).  ","h":14,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-1","r":1.0,"t":"Do not recommend! Has a bitter taste.","x":"The product looks very nice, the design is pretty, but the product itself is not good. It has a bitter taste, also leaves unpleasant bitterness when wiped clean off the lips. I do not recommend this balm. Have to throw it away. However, sheer pink tint was suitable for me.","h":14,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-2","r":5.0,"t":"LOVE Winky Lux products!","x":"Love this balm! Great look to the case, small enough for an evening clutch and gives a great pop of color!!","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-3","r":1.0,"t":"Tastes awful!","x":"Feels good, not much color, tastes horrible. Not usable. Don\u2019t buy it.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-4","r":5.0,"t":"Sheer & Beautiful","x":"Such a beautiful sheen! If you like sparkle, this is for you! Very moisturizing, and the pigment is sheer and natural. LOVE THIS!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-5","r":5.0,"t":"I love winky lux!","x":"Smooth application and long lasting appearance with pH balancing!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-6","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful staining lipstick","x":"The glimmer balm in gold is pretty and subtle. The color change is a nice pink hue and not a super hot 90s pink like other brands. It also stains your lips, which was what I hoped for because I didn\u2019t want my face masks stained with lipstick. I love this as it\u2019s moisturizing and the color is long lasting.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-7","r":5.0,"t":"My new favorite lip balm!","x":"Turns my lips a gorgeous shade of natural pink that stays all day! So easy to wear and gives me the extra boost of confidence I need!","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-8","r":4.0,"t":"Not worth the money","x":"Has a bit of a chemical taste, but beautiful packaging","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-9","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect pink with a little sparkle!","x":"It\u2019s gorgeous and goes on a perfect shade of pink!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-10","r":5.0,"t":"gorgeous little tube","x":"I am very happy with this lipstick--it is light but perfect for me. It is beautiful--feels like an elegant touch--the lipstick is a little sparkly in the tube which I like very much. I have another kind that gets too bright--this one is my hands down favorite and I haven't noticed it drying out my lips like most everything else does. This is now my goto lipstick. Love it!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-11","r":4.0,"t":"so pretty!!!","x":"the lip stick looks gold but no ,no it tints your lips to a wonderful pink . i love this product not only is it pretty , but it works very well. The only thing i would say is that it does taste very bad to me :( .","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-12","r":4.0,"t":"Great neutral color","x":"I love that this neutralizes to your own skin tone! Very moisturizing but I wish it lasted a little longer.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-13","r":4.0,"t":"Pretty color but bitter taste and tingley sensation","x":"So it's very pretty packaging and it does exactly what it says it does. It's a clear yellowish orange jelly balm with gold shimmer that turns a bright pink for me after a few seconds. It has a pleasant makeup smell but it does have a bitter taste, but then again you aren't supposed to lick or eat it.  I was a little concerned because it did kind of have a tingley burn sensation for me almost immediately, but I guess that could be something to plump up your lips? Or maybe I'm allergic to an ingre","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-14","r":3.0,"t":"Plastic cheap feel","x":"It doesn't stay on long, you will have to constantly reapply. The case is lightweight and plastic-y. Gets scratched up easy in your purse of make up bag.  Pleasant scent and feel on the lips tho. Not sticky.  Its just okay....","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-15","r":5.0,"t":"Very pleased!!","x":"I am so happy with this lip gloss. I was struggling with paying $30 for the Dior version and I actually like the color on this one much better. It has a beautiful pink tint that is rich and deep yet very soft!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-16","r":1.0,"t":"There is A LOT better quality out there!","x":"I am not a fan of Carmex at all, this is pretty packaged Carmex!!!!  It has the same smell and dried my lips out. Sorry I was NOT a fan. If you want mood pink lipgloss L.A Colors Mood is the way to go!!!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-17","r":5.0,"t":"Color is not as expected","x":"This is very pink... i had no idea it Would change so much.  Color is really Ugly...I wanted a gold sparkle to layer Over some  my other lipsticks And i paid 16.00 for nothing. Very disappointed.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-18","r":5.0,"t":"My lips look great!","x":"I love that Winky Lux goes on smooth, keeps my lips moist, and pulls the pigment from natural coloring!  This is a must have.  As a 50yo, it's nice to wear something that doesn't bleed and lasts!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-19","r":4.0,"t":"Pretty in pink","x":"This product is really neat. It works well for moisturizing and giving a bit of natural color. I love the casing as well, so elegant. But it does leave a weird taste on your lips.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-20","r":3.0,"t":"Eh...","x":"I bought this lipbalm because the color came nice pink on the girl in the video below,  however it wore on me as bright hot pink... which was not what I was looking for","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-21","r":4.0,"t":"Worth every penny!","x":"Love it!! Compact & glam, gives a luminous gloss to your lips leaving them moist & shiny. Will be ordering more as gifts!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-22","r":5.0,"t":"Just the berries","x":"My daughter the bride and her attendants seen this and they all loved it. I like it it made my daughter happy","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-23","r":5.0,"t":"Buy this! Great color, feels great","x":"Great chapstick. The color is more in the pink side for me. But the color lasts a long time and it\u2019s pretty!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07HHCHF7Y-24","r":1.0,"t":"Tastes AWFUL","x":"The product itself is gorgeous, it looks nice and it is really moisturizing but damn, it tastes awful. :c","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers love the product, praising its color, moisturizing feel, and pH-changing tint.","cites":[1,3,5,6,7,8,10,11,12,13]},{"text":"A common complaint is a bitter or chemical taste.","cites":[2,4,9,12,14]},{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the pretty, elegant packaging and tube design.","cites":[2,3,9,11,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the product does not last long and requires frequent reapplication.","cites":[13,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers feel the product is not worth the price or has a cheap plastic feel.","cites":[1,9,15]}]},"qa":[]}